# churn-knot: bodies in each other's way while the map changes beside them. A static change that touches a route
# has it refreshed, and the stall clock's record is re-based to where the body stands under the new route: a body
# one step back from its best place then read its next step forward as a gain, and its knot's dead age restarted
# with every change. With the map changing more often than every 4,800 ticks the knot's orders never ended.
#  K  a 3x3 body (attack-move east) against a 2x2 body (attack-move west) in a lane 3 cells wide and 60 long, no
#     pocket: no give-way opens anything, and the long stand-down ends both orders.
#  P  the same pair in a lane with one pocket 4x4 in its north wall: the give-way lets both through.
#  M  as P on move orders: the pocket lies too far back for the give-way (see pocket-far), the pair shuffles, and
#     the long stand-down ends both orders. This is the lane the changes kept alive: both stood for good.
#  O  a route that opens: the K pair again (the big body's goal 320 cells east); at tick 3,000 the lane is closed
#     beyond the small body and a door behind the big one opens into a second lane that leads on east. The big body
#     turns round, walks back to the door and on through the second lane, and arrives near tick 7,000, well past
#     the tick the long stand-down would have ended its order at with the door shut (5,2xx): headway on a new
#     route is progress, also where it begins by going back over ground the body remembers.
# A 1x1 feature on open ground beside lane M's east mouth, closing no way, is placed and lifted every 1,500 ticks.
# Read at start offset 0 (legion_routeopens: O's two arrive) and at 0, 1, -1 (legion_churnknot: M's orders end,
# nobody stands stuck). The meets move with the start offset: at +1 lane K's pair pass each other and lane O's
# meet at the west mouth, before the door (their orders end at the long threshold); at -1 lane M's give-way works.
# Keys (with --scale): g.MB / g.MS.complete_n (1: the orders end), g.KB / g.KS.complete_n, g.PB / g.PS.arrived,
# g.OB / g.OS.arrived, scale.stuck_end (0), work.stand_downs.total, work.give_ways.total.
scn 1
name churn-knot
ticks 9000
seed 7
players 1
weapons off
map flat 400 208
wall 34 0 60 30
wall 34 33 60 8
wall 34 44 28 20
wall 66 44 28 20
wall 62 44 4 16
wall 34 67 60 9
wall 34 79 28 20
wall 66 79 28 20
wall 62 79 4 16
wall 34 102 60 72
wall 34 177 10 7
wall 48 177 46 7
wall 34 184 4 3
wall 34 187 60 21
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
type big mover 3 2500 10 1.5
group KB 0 big 1 cells 20,30
group KS 0 m 1 cells 108,31
group PB 0 big 1 cells 20,64
group PS 0 m 1 cells 108,65
group MB 0 big 1 cells 20,99
group MS 0 m 1 cells 108,100
group OB 0 big 1 cells 20,174
group OS 0 m 1 cells 108,175
churn 100 105 1 1 every=1500 toggle from=110
churn 44 177 4 1 every=2999 toggle from=1 until=3001
churn 80 174 1 3 every=100000 from=3000
at 2 fight KB 112 31
at 2 fight KS 8 31
at 2 fight PB 112 65
at 2 fight PS 8 65
at 2 move MB 112 100
at 2 move MS 8 100
at 2 fight OB 380 175
at 2 fight OS 8 175
